{"about_the_game":"&quot;First Racer&quot; is an arcade racing game that puts you behind the wheel of racing cars. With intuitive controls and a wide selection of vehicles, you'll need quick reactions and a competitive spirit to become the winner. The game features fast-paced races filled with adrenaline on various tracks, each with its own unique features. Whether you're an experienced player or a newcomer to the racing genre, &quot;First Racer&quot; offers an exciting and immersive experience that will have you coming back again and again. So get ready to rev up your engines and show your competitiveness!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364690/extras/6f3c55d3f63f82dded3ee25ca61f6b11.poster.avif?t=1775636498\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364690/extras/6f3c55d3f63f82dded3ee25ca61f6b11.webm?t=1775636498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364690/extras/6f3c55d3f63f82dded3ee25ca61f6b11.mp4?t=1775636498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In First Racer, you can choose a car, upgrade its performance, adjust its settings, and change its appearance. You can make decisions that impact the handling, speed, and acceleration of your cars, allowing you to customize your car to your racing style. Additionally, you can change the appearance of your cars by choosing different colors, stickers, wheels, and other cosmetic upgrades.<br><br>In the game, there are different game modes:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364690/extras/b1403da24c7e3f26f55b50a6ce91a4db.poster.avif?t=1775636498\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364690/extras/b1403da24c7e3f26f55b50a6ce91a4db.webm?t=1775636498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364690/extras/b1403da24c7e3f26f55b50a6ce91a4db.mp4?t=1775636498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Racing: Drivers compete with each other to cross the finish line first. Races can take place on a track or in a city environment.<br></li><li>Drifting: Drivers attempt to perform the longest and most impressive drift, sliding around corners with their car while maintaining control. Points are awarded based on speed, angle, and style of the drift.<br></li><li>Off-Road Racing: Drivers participate in races that take place on rough, un-paved terrain such as dirt or gravel roads. Vehicles are usually modified with larger tires, increased clearance, and improved traction to overcome the challenging conditions. The main focus is on high-speed driving, maneuverability, and the durability of the vehicle.</li></ul><br>You can use a gamepad to control the car, giving you a more realistic and comfortable gaming experience. The gamepad will allow you to easily and accurately control the car.<br><br>The game supports the &quot;FANATEC CSL Elite PS4&quot; racing wheel (other wheels from the &quot;FANATEC&quot; company should also work). Support for wheels from other manufacturers is also planned for the future.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"338cf10a982b0ea59747a5f06187c69b6f76286f.jpg","localized_name":"Win","name":"Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1364690/338cf10a982b0ea59747a5f06187c69b6f76286f.jpg"},{"icon":"ba4eae65729f9befe31a8222e7b0f51a1a37a64b.jpg","localized_name":"10 Wins","name":"10 Wins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1364690/ba4eae65729f9befe31a8222e7b0f51a1a37a64b.jpg"},{"icon":"46dfe342c1218eaf9eb1a3544b154296130ed8f2.jpg","localize