 tires, increased clearance, and improved traction to overcome the challenging conditions. The main focus is on high-speed driving, maneuverability, and the durability of the vehicle.</li></ul><br>You can use a gamepad to control the car, giving you a more realistic and comfortable gaming experience. The gamepad will allow you to easily and accurately control the car.<br><br>The game supports the &quot;FANATEC CSL Elite PS4&quot; racing wheel (other wheels from the &quot;FANATEC&quot; company should also work). Support for wheels from other manufacturers is also planned for the future.","developers":["Perfect Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364690/header.jpg?t=1775636498","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1364690/622561/1cd1ae80ad605f123e3d4ca05c737b5454a3ca80/1751227512/dash_av1.mpd?t=1698313965","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1364690/622561/1cd1ae80ad605f123e3d4ca05c737b5454a3ca80/1751227512/dash_h264.mpd?t=1698313965","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1364690/622561/1cd1ae80ad605f123e3d4ca05c737b5454a3ca80/1751227512/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1698313965","id":256978204,"name":"Trailer_1.15","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256978204/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1698313965"}],"name":"First Racer","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"First Racer - $4.99 USD","packageid":478660,"percent_savin